WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.245
Poetry uses rhythm, carefully chosen words, imagery and sometimes rhyme. Four lines

00:00:05.245 --> 00:00:07.347
can express one clear idea.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.315
Which pair of words rhymes? Answer: light and night

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.020
Write a four-line poem about your school or a rainy afternoon and recite it with

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:17.341
expression.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.101
Discuss why: Light and night share a final sound.
